QMK / Vial-QMK Setup Guide (macOS Intel)

This guide reproduces the working environment for the user's Vial-QMK repository.

1. Install Apple Command Line Tools

xcode-select --install

2. Install Homebrew

/bin/bash -c "$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)"

3. Install Python 3.13

brew install python@3.13
brew unlink python 2>/dev/null
brew unlink python@3.14 2>/dev/null
brew link --overwrite --force python@3.13

4. Add Python 3.13 to PATH

export PATH="/usr/local/opt/python@3.13/bin:/usr/local/opt/python@3.13/libexec/bin:$PATH"

5. Install uv

brew install uv

6. Install QMK CLI

uv tool uninstall qmk
uv tool install --python /usr/local/opt/python@3.13/bin/python3.13 qmk

7. Verify QMK Python

QMK_PYTHON="$(head -1 "$(which qmk)" | sed 's/^#!//')"
"$QMK_PYTHON" -c 'import sys, ast; print(sys.version); print(hasattr(ast,"Num"))'

8. Install AVR Toolchain

brew tap osx-cross/avr
brew install avr-gcc@8
brew install avr-binutils

9. Add AVR to PATH

export PATH="/usr/local/opt/avr-gcc@8/bin:/usr/local/opt/avr-binutils/bin:$PATH"

10. Clone/Open Repository

git submodule update --init --recursive

11. Configure QMK Home

qmk config user.qmk_home="$HOME/Documents/GitHub/vial-qmk-alectardy98_07"

12. Verify

qmk doctor
which avr-gcc
avr-gcc --version

13. Build

make clean
make xwhatsit2/ibm/fxtal/universal:vial_Karolus